            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NCP302 and NCP303 series are second generation ultra-low current voltage detectors that contain a programmable time delay generator. These devices are specifically designed for use as reset controllers in portable microprocessor based systems where extended battery life is paramount. </rdf:li>
